OL,5,G1400 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FAlison hunts for a home in
OL,7,     FFrance's stunning Dordogne region
OL,8,     Ffor her #300k. From light-filled,
OL,9,     Fopen-plan opulence to charming
OL,10,     Fchateau feels, will any places be
OL,11,     Fthe creme de la creme?
OL,12,G1500 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FSutton Coldfield. French foodie
OL,14,     FLaetitia plans to impress her
OL,15,     Fguests with snails, foie gras,
OL,16,     Fveal and a traditional cheese
OL,17,     Fcourse. But Patrick's opinions
OL,18,     Fprove hard to swallow. (Ep1/5)
