OL,5,G1730 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FJane and Jilly from Brighton want
OL,7,     Fto buy a holiday home in the
OL,8,     Fpicturesque Dordogne region of
OL,9,     Fsouth west France, on a budget of
OL,10,     F#100,000. Laura Hamilton shows
OL,11,     Fthem five great places.
OL,12,G1800 Kirstie and Phil's Love It or...
OL,13,     F...List It: In Hamilton, Scott and
OL,14,     FJaqui's once-perfect pad is now a
OL,15,     Fdomestic battleground. With
OL,16,     Fcompromise in short supply, can
OL,17,     FKirstie nail it with the extra
OL,18,     Fspace they need?
