OL,5,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FAdrian has injuries to his face
OL,7,     Fand has been bitten on his arm
OL,8,     Fbreaking up a fight in the city
OL,9,     Fcentre. Andy's had a motorbike
OL,10,     Faccident. And Connor's fallen 12
OL,11,     Ffeet off a roof.
OL,12,G2200 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics treat a young woman
OL,14,     Fwho's passed out for the third
OL,15,     Ftime that day and a man in his 40s
OL,16,     Fwith chest pain and a family
OL,17,     Fhistory of heart failure.
